{
  "statement": "The Safety and Reliability dimension is paramount for the RollCall system. I support the merging of TRU-02 and RES-06 to streamline role-based access control, as this enhances our security framework without compromising safety. However, we must ensure that safety audits (SAF-07) are included in this unified requirement to maintain a robust security posture. Regarding the integration of EFF-04 and RES-07 for five-year historical data retention, it is essential to maintain our focus on fault tolerance and data accuracy, ensuring that any storage solutions comply with safety protocols. I propose that we incorporate provisions for automated safety checks in the data handling process.",
